  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISA II _ Water Productivity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aanvulling: Eerder onder aanvraag 400000267 geregistreerd! Dear Berry, As per our discussion this morning, please find attached the documents pertaining the Water Productivity &#x2013; a Water project integrated in the ISA II programme. We kindle request your assistance in having the activity and contract commitment registered under SBE 1702U0203008 &#x2013; Integrated Water Management. There are 3 payments pending approval of contract commitment. Attached please find the approval documents: - Adjustment Bemo trim # MINBUZA-2021.1010513 - Amendment to the Arrangement trim # MINBUZA-2021.1048823 - 3 approved payment order forms not yet saved in Sophia. I am very sorry for the inconvenience caused by our mistake of not consulting with you prior to the submission of the above documents. Hoping we can still finalize the process in the course of 2021 and effectuate the related payments. Thank you and regards, Paula Albrinho Financial Advisor</narrative>
  </description>
